{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">啟德簡約公屋有女嬰在家中昏迷，送院後不治。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">一歲女嬰送到廣華醫院治理，家屬到場了解，女嬰經搶救後不治。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.BABY-0730.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026AftuPkcmVb1788998748.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.BABY-0730.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事發地點在世運道簡約公屋第六座。警方清晨約5時半接到女嬰媽媽報案，指發現女兒在家中昏迷，沒有呼吸和脈搏，意外原因仍在調查。據了解，女嬰患有心臟及腦疾病，需要一直覆診及用藥。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.BABY-0730_005.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026vtMHj5LIeL1789006379.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.BABY-0730_005.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-10T03:19:56.541666+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}